<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36462" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pistris</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pristis</span></b> , is (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pistrix</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pristix</span></b> ,
		ĭcis), f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίστρις,
			πρίστις</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>any sea-monster; a
				whale</i>, <i>shark</i>, <i>sawfish</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">postrema immani corpore pistrix (of Scylla),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 3, 427</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in Indico mari pristes ducenum cubitorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 9,
					3, 2, § 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jamque agmine toto Pistris adest,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 2, 530</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">marina pistrix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					3, 5, 16</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>The constellation of the Whale</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ad Pistricis terga,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Arat. 152</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Auster Pistrin agit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">German. Arat. 358</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A species of swift-sailing ship</i>, Quadrig. ap.
					<i><span class="en">Non. 535, 26</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 35,
				26, 1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>Name of a ship in the fleet of Æneas</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Verg.
				A. 5, 116</span></i>.</div>
